Subtask 2.3: Creating and Running Ansible Playbooks
Create the main deployment playbook:
cat > playbooks/deploy-tuned-profiles.yml << 'EOF'
---
- name: Deploy and Configure tuned Profiles
  hosts: all
  become: yes
  gather_facts: yes

