Deliverable for Task 3: Three result files under /tmp/cpu_benchmarks/, one per profile (balanced, throughput-performance, latency-performance), each showing the elapsed time to find all primes below 200000. Students should observe elapsed times in the same general range (since this is a single-threaded CPU-bound task, tuned's I/O and scheduler tuning has limited effect on it) while confirming the correct profile name is recorded in each file and that tuned-adm active matched the intended profile at benchmark time.

